{
    "title": "Walmart Business: B2B Shopping",
    "description": "The Walmart Business app makes it easy to shop, track and save on the go.\r\n\r\nMake shopping for your business or nonprofit easier than ever with the Walmart Business app. Stock up on must-haves, buy in bulk, track your delivery or pickup status and save with low prices when you shop on the go\u2014hassle-free. \r\nWhether you're a small, large or medium sized business, or run an office, school or nonprofit organization, the Walmart Business app is the simplest, most convenient way to shop and stay on budget.\r\nBreakroom snacks, fresh food, health and cleaning products, office equipment and furniture, kitchen appliances and the latest tech, Walmart Business has what your organization needs.\r\n\r\nPlus, our everyday low prices and convenient store pickup, express delivery and shipping options make it a breeze to get your business essentials exactly when you want them, whether you\u2019re shopping in-store or online. \r\n\r\nBuy in bulk for your business.\r\n\r\nStock up on those everyday office supplies when you buy in bulk with the Walmart Business app. Shop our online marketplace for all your cleaning supplies, snacks, drinks, printer paper, toner, office furniture and new tech needs.\r\n\r\n\r\nConvenient ways to get your items:\r\n\r\nPickup \r\nSwing by the store to collect your order curbside when you\u2019re out on the go. Check in with the app when you arrive\u2014we\u2019ll even load your car. Get free curbside pickup at Walmart stores on eligible orders over $35. (Restrictions apply.) \r\n\r\nRegular and express delivery options\r\nFrom a local store straight to your office. For those need-it-now moments, choose express delivery in the Walmart Business app to get your order in as fast as 1 hour. * \r\n*Express delivery subject to availability at select stores. Restrictions and fees apply. \r\n\r\nShipping \r\nGet your shopping delivered with fast shipping, dropped off by FedEx or UPS. Eligible orders over $35 ship free! \r\n\r\nEven more time-saving features you\u2019ll love: \r\n\r\nOrder tracking \r\nSee exactly when your order is ready for pickup or delivery right from the app.\r\n\r\nShared payments \r\nMake shopping stress-free when buying in bulk for your business. Share your card with your team and pay easily with one payment method.\r\n\r\nShopping lists \r\nCreate, share and add to lists so you never forget a thing. \r\n\r\nAutomatic deliveries\r\nEasily set up subscriptions for all those frequently bought items. Need stationery for classrooms every quarter, supplies for doctors\u2019 offices every month or maybe coffee for the office every two weeks? Just set up your regular orders on automatic delivery so you can focus on what matters most.\r\n\r\n\r\nEasy item finder \r\nFind just what you\u2019re looking for in a flash by scanning an item\u2019s barcode or visiting our industry-specific pages that make shopping online for your business easier than ever.\r\n\r\nAll your purchases in one place:\r\nCheck out in store with Walmart Pay in the Walmart Business mobile app and all your in-store purchases will save to your account. You can also leave the card at home and pay with a shared card from your phone.\r\nHaving all your online & in-store purchases in one place will help you with expense tracking and reconciliation.\r\n\r\nTax-exempt shopping:\r\nEligible organizations can apply their tax-exempt status to online and in-store purchases seamlessly. Enroll in the Walmart Tax Exempt Program through Walmart Business, check out in-store using Walmart Pay in the app and all the corresponding taxes will be automatically removed. \r\n\r\n\r\nWalmart Business+:\r\nSign up for a Walmart Business+ membership for additional benefits such as earning rewards on purchases over $250 (restrictions apply), access to spend analytics for insights and many more.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Walmart Business app makes it easy to shop, track and save on the go.<br><br>Make shopping for your business or nonprofit easier than ever with the Walmart Business app. Stock up on must-haves, buy in bulk, track your delivery or pickup status and save with low prices when you shop on the go\u2014hassle-free. <br>Whether you&#39;re a small, large or medium sized business, or run an office, school or nonprofit organization, the Walmart Business app is the simplest, most convenient way to shop and stay on budget.<br>Breakroom snacks, fresh food, health and cleaning products, office equipment and furniture, kitchen appliances and the latest tech, Walmart Business has what your organization needs.<br><br>Plus, our everyday low prices and convenient store pickup, express delivery and shipping options make it a breeze to get your business essentials exactly when you want them, whether you\u2019re shopping in-store or online. <br><br>Buy in bulk for your business.<br><br>Stock up on those everyday office supplies when you buy in bulk with the Walmart Business app. Shop our online marketplace for all your cleaning supplies, snacks, drinks, printer paper, toner, office furniture and new tech needs.<br><br><br>Convenient ways to get your items:<br><br>Pickup <br>Swing by the store to collect your order curbside when you\u2019re out on the go. Check in with the app when you arrive\u2014we\u2019ll even load your car. Get free curbside pickup at Walmart stores on eligible orders over $35. (Restrictions apply.) <br><br>Regular and express delivery options<br>From a local store straight to your office. For those need-it-now moments, choose express delivery in the Walmart Business app to get your order in as fast as 1 hour. * <br>*Express delivery subject to availability at select stores. Restrictions and fees apply. <br><br>Shipping <br>Get your shopping delivered with fast shipping, dropped off by FedEx or UPS. Eligible orders over $35 ship free! <br><br>Even more time-saving features you\u2019ll love: <br><br>Order tracking <br>See exactly when your order is ready for pickup or delivery right from the app.<br><br>Shared payments <br>Make shopping stress-free when buying in bulk for your business. Share your card with your team and pay easily with one payment method.<br><br>Shopping lists <br>Create, share and add to lists so you never forget a thing. <br><br>Automatic deliveries<br>Easily set up subscriptions for all those frequently bought items. Need stationery for classrooms every quarter, supplies for doctors\u2019 offices every month or maybe coffee for the office every two weeks? Just set up your regular orders on automatic delivery so you can focus on what matters most.<br><br><br>Easy item finder <br>Find just what you\u2019re looking for in a flash by scanning an item\u2019s barcode or visiting our industry-specific pages that make shopping online for your business easier than ever.<br><br>All your purchases in one place:<br>Check out in store with Walmart Pay in the Walmart Business mobile app and all your in-store purchases will save to your account. You can also leave the card at home and pay with a shared card from your phone.<br>Having all your online &amp; in-store purchases in one place will help you with expense tracking and reconciliation.<br><br>Tax-exempt shopping:<br>Eligible organizations can apply their tax-exempt status to online and in-store purchases seamlessly. Enroll in the Walmart Tax Exempt Program through Walmart Business, check out in-store using Walmart Pay in the app and all the corresponding taxes will be automatically removed. <br><br><br>Walmart Business+:<br>Sign up for a Walmart Business+ membership for additional benefits such as earning rewards on purchases over $250 (restrictions apply), access to spend analytics for insights and many more.",
